### ====================================================================
### GOOGLE NEWS CRAWLER - HTTP CLIENT TEST SUITE (.http)
### Native support for JetBrains (PyCharm / IntelliJ) & VS Code REST Client
### ====================================================================

### 1. Healthcheck & Uptime Inspection
# @name healthcheck
GET {{base_url}}/health
Accept: application/json

###

### 2. Trigger Crawl Job - Unauthorized (Expect 401 Unauthorized)
# @name trigger_unauthorized
POST {{base_url}}/api/v1/crawl/trigger
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "keyword": "Trillion"
}

###

### 3. Trigger Crawl Job - Default Parameters (Requires X-API-Key)
# @name trigger_default
POST {{base_url}}/api/v1/crawl/trigger
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{api_key}}

{
  "keyword": "Trillion",
  "max_articles": 3,
  "workers": 2
}

> {%
    if (response.status === 202) {
        client.global.set("job_id", response.body.job_id);
        client.log("Job scheduled successfully. Assigned job_id: " + response.body.job_id);
    }
%}

###

### 4. Trigger Crawl Job - Full CLI Parameters (Custom Lang, Country, Proxy, Timeout)
# @name trigger_custom
POST {{base_url}}/api/v1/crawl/trigger
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{api_key}}

{
  "keyword": "Trillion",
  "max_articles": 3,
  "workers": 2,
  "lang": "vi",
  "country": "VN",
  "timeout": 12,
  "proxy": null,
  "rotate_ua": true,
  "resume": true,
  "show_progress": false
}

###

### 5. Trigger Crawl Job via GET Query (Alternative for simple cron-job.org GET callers)
# @name trigger_via_get
GET {{base_url}}/api/v1/crawl/trigger?keyword=Semiconductor&max=2&key={{api_key}}

###

### 6. Query Latest Job Status
# @name get_latest_job
GET {{base_url}}/api/v1/jobs/latest
Accept: application/json

###

### 7. Query Specific Job by ID (Dynamic {{job_id}} captured from Step 3)
# @name get_job_by_id
GET {{base_url}}/api/v1/jobs/{{job_id}}
Accept: application/json

###

### 8. Download Output Excel File (.xlsx)
# @name download_excel
GET {{base_url}}/api/v1/jobs/{{job_id}}/download/excel

###

### 9. Download Checkpoint JSONL File (.jsonl)
# @name download_jsonl
GET {{base_url}}/api/v1/jobs/{{job_id}}/download/jsonl

###

### ====================================================================
### CLOUDFLARE WORKER EDGE ENDPOINT TESTS
### ====================================================================

### 10. Cloudflare Worker - Healthcheck
# @name worker_healthcheck
GET {{worker_url}}/health
Accept: application/json

###

### 11. Cloudflare Worker - Trigger Crawl (Forwarding to FastAPI Backend)
# @name worker_trigger
POST {{worker_url}}/trigger
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{api_key}}

{
  "keyword": "AI News",
  "max_articles": 3
}
